2026-07-27T09:50:19.6577002Z i /tmp/Rtmp0uJ1YY/duckdb
2026-07-27T09:50:19.6577351Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T09:50:19.6577749Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:50:19.6578120Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:50:19.6578792Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:50:19.6579736Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:50:19.6580780Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
